  "description": "QIQTES crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C102 H108 Eu4 N18 O42 Zn3,6(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 2 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 2 O neighbors; Zn3 (Zn) has 2 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 2 pairs, 5 components; largest component is a chain with insufficient metal sites for a 3D shape classification. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.567-3.567 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.38-97.44°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Zn3Eu4C114H126N24O42.",
